    {
      "id": "u_0fec3b78615d0c0709b992fd_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The following shapes can be drawn on the map: a path, an area, a rectangle or a circle.",
      "sourceHash": "0fec3b78615d0c0709b992fd547af63e182fa5cd43e91ee24018d0b7fe8c7635",
      "context": "Drawing shapes",
      "contextHash": "9529375c180d0c9dd6e71c2b9a2a12ce3e1776d8f84fb23ee66aad586352c9a6",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "マップ上には、パス、領域、長方形、円の図形を描画できます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1e114b28ba497aec6140d1a9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Unlike markers, the title of the shape is not displayed directly on the map but it will be displayed when hovered.",
      "sourceHash": "1e114b28ba497aec6140d1a9118417ed6cff42bcc26520c2e0b90d152b424d0c",
      "context": "Drawing shapes",
      "contextHash": "9529375c180d0c9dd6e71c2b9a2a12ce3e1776d8f84fb23ee66aad586352c9a6",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "マーカーとは異なり、図形のタイトルはマップ上に直接表示されませんが、マウスオーバーすると表示されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_90f34785092a96851236db02_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The shape will also be drawn in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__color of the note__TRILIUM_PH_1__, if set. ",
      "sourceHash": "90f34785092a96851236db027f9b4271d14ed80b00ac026e91d7c2ff9b7e548a",
      "context": "Drawing shapes",
      "contextHash": "9529375c180d0c9dd6e71c2b9a2a12ce3e1776d8f84fb23ee66aad586352c9a6",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "また、設定されている場合、図形は__TRILIUM_PH_0__ノートの色__TRILIUM_PH_1__で描画されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9661b8e05d89b7245068ab4f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Drawing a shape on the map__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "9661b8e05d89b7245068ab4f58bb2b7be3a366d6724117a78fa0c53fe9d0a0bc",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Drawing a shape on the map",
      "contextHash": "5ceedfc01a316af92e944ad7a818ba53cbd833dc34076db956b64fa0ab733ddd",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "マップ上に図形を描画する__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f57e2e575ab31e3647b199a1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To draw a shape, use the toolbar that appears in the top-center area on desktop and on the left-center on mobile and in split view.",
      "sourceHash": "f57e2e575ab31e3647b199a1d7a5b6f617bcb9743315526e673d7c385174884b",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Drawing a shape on the map",
      "contextHash": "5ceedfc01a316af92e944ad7a818ba53cbd833dc34076db956b64fa0ab733ddd",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "図形を描画するには、デスクトップでは上部中央、モバイルおよび分割表示では左側中央に表示されるツールバーを使用します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7f51463dcf598c82b87729ff_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Once a shape is drawn, it cannot be moved or modified. To do so, simply remove the shape and draw another one instead.",
      "sourceHash": "7f51463dcf598c82b87729ff3f62647fd053fef69e44a2a882d91d6d327a192a",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Drawing a shape on the map",
      "contextHash": "5ceedfc01a316af92e944ad7a818ba53cbd833dc34076db956b64fa0ab733ddd",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "一度描画した図形は、移動や変更を行うことができません。変更するには、単にその図形を削除して代わりに別の図形を描画してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_db32fd35df8f6098ad7e6678_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Drawing a path or an area__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "db32fd35df8f6098ad7e6678910b9debedeec427309a50f0fd51c6e5b8bcaeec",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Drawing a shape on the map > Drawing a path or an area",
      "contextHash": "d2104ef15bc4348ec8439a05e5a0ad62440f5a2bff269a7f74e699a61c7eb1c8",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "パスまたは領域を描画する__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6f28a2ff80cb20572cd4f1d7_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Draw a path on the map__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (__TRILIUM_PH_2__) or __TRILIUM_PH_3__Draw an area on the map__TRILIUM_PH_4__ (__TRILIUM_PH_5__) button. The button stays held down while the tool is armed, and a notification describes what to do.",
      "sourceHash": "6f28a2ff80cb20572cd4f1d7b85c87d8b058c45257f0746600b3600fdc158541",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Drawing a shape on the map > Drawing a path or an area",
      "contextHash": "d2104ef15bc4348ec8439a05e5a0ad62440f5a2bff269a7f74e699a61c7eb1c8",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__マップ上にパスを描画__TRILIUM_PH_1__（__TRILIUM_PH_2__）または__TRILIUM_PH_3__マップ上に領域を描画__TRILIUM_PH_4__（__TRILIUM_PH_5__）ボタンを押します。ツールが有効な間はボタンが押された状態になり、操作方法を説明する通知が表示されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_97ee293a442aa346d3f25b2e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Click on the map once for each point. The shape is previewed as it grows.",
      "sourceHash": "97ee293a442aa346d3f25b2e64db3284d09d73713f8fd6c013751aa9bb76ca00",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Drawing a shape on the map > Drawing a path or an area",
      "contextHash": "d2104ef15bc4348ec8439a05e5a0ad62440f5a2bff269a7f74e699a61c7eb1c8",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "ポイントごとにマップ上を1回クリックします。図形は拡大しながらプレビューされます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_61bab66cef0a7e79baa09c23_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Finish it by pressing __TRILIUM_PH_0__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_1__. A path can also be finished by clicking its last point again, and an area by clicking the corner it started from. A path needs at least two points and an area at least three.",
      "sourceHash": "61bab66cef0a7e79baa09c234891a39ab0cd9c5e4e4d51dbf078b1ac9184b9a8",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Drawing a shape on the map > Drawing a path or an area",
      "contextHash": "d2104ef15bc4348ec8439a05e5a0ad62440f5a2bff269a7f74e699a61c7eb1c8",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Enter__TRILIUM_PH_1__を押して完了します。最後のポイントをもう一度クリックすることでもパスを完了でき、開始した角をクリックすることで領域を完了できます。パスには少なくとも2つのポイント、領域には少なくとも3つのポイントが必要です。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
