    {
      "id": "u_c1d199e6599e879e6ff119ce_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Draw a rectangle on the map__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (__TRILIUM_PH_2__) or __TRILIUM_PH_3__Draw a circle on the map__TRILIUM_PH_4__ (__TRILIUM_PH_5__) button.",
      "sourceHash": "c1d199e6599e879e6ff119ceca147e643fd24aa52ddca052a0c8db7577d1e1d3",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Drawing a shape on the map > Drawing a rectangle or a circle",
      "contextHash": "5e45e3ffa16238153ff6ab1901e6c4cbf8de61ce680c80a9723eb2b5effb3b5d",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__マップ上に長方形を描画__TRILIUM_PH_1__（__TRILIUM_PH_2__）または__TRILIUM_PH_3__マップ上に円を描画__TRILIUM_PH_4__（__TRILIUM_PH_5__）ボタンを押します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6db068079c66ae6aa2bd681a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Click once to set the first corner, or the center of the circle. Click a second time at the opposite corner, or at the distance the circle should reach.",
      "sourceHash": "6db068079c66ae6aa2bd681a7cd64bdfe745a93346897c7e0f9f5e12e47378d7",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Drawing a shape on the map > Drawing a rectangle or a circle",
      "contextHash": "5e45e3ffa16238153ff6ab1901e6c4cbf8de61ce680c80a9723eb2b5effb3b5d",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "最初の角または円の中心を設定するために1回クリックします。反対側の角、または円が到達すべき距離の場所でもう一度クリックします。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_6d10c2d5fe0d52ddb5d62878_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Instead of two clicks you can drag from one to the other. This also works on mobile and other touch-based apps.",
      "sourceHash": "6d10c2d5fe0d52ddb5d6287885fe124d9b6f081c7b806cf437b7efdad2b6a457",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Drawing a shape on the map > Drawing a rectangle or a circle",
      "contextHash": "5e45e3ffa16238153ff6ab1901e6c4cbf8de61ce680c80a9723eb2b5effb3b5d",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "2回クリックする代わりに、一方からもう一方へドラッグすることもできます。これはモバイルやその他のタッチベースのアプリでも機能します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
