    },
    {
      "id": "u_7587ea5d01dda02e0b673211_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To give up on a shape while drawing it, press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Escape__TRILIUM_PH_1__ or press the tool's button again. Whatever has been drawn so far is discarded.",
      "sourceHash": "7587ea5d01dda02e0b6732115589993b297a936f9150295fdfc92e26907e30cb",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Drawing a shape on the map > Finishing and cancelling",
      "contextHash": "31a3731258774b973af853e1e698298f42ee8340009f5db26e0904f696a9e62d",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "描画中の図形を途中でやめるには、__TRILIUM_PH_0__Escape__TRILIUM_PH_1__を押すか、ツールのボタンをもう一度押します。それまでに描画されたものは破棄されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0ef50ef0a56479921d6382a6_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The tool is deactivated once a shape is finished, so drawing a second shape requires another button press.",
      "sourceHash": "0ef50ef0a56479921d6382a6317055647c11d85eb594aa62ce7cca4763c43748",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Drawing a shape on the map > Finishing and cancelling",
      "contextHash": "31a3731258774b973af853e1e698298f42ee8340009f5db26e0904f696a9e62d",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "図形が完成するとツールは無効化されるため、2つ目の図形を描画するには再度ボタンを押す必要があります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
