      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ae3050fb7a97529385c154c9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Clicking a shape opens the standard panel which allows changing the title, the content and with buttons to open the note or remove it.",
      "sourceHash": "ae3050fb7a97529385c154c9c7965cff64a52e1b43ce2d06cd16d9b445d0f9e2",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "de78cf97cf58bb730420b2c74d6996b850bfe147fa535cedf436a2563762d7fb",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "図形をクリックすると標準パネルが開き、タイトルやコンテンツの変更、ノートを開く、または削除するためのボタンが表示されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7fb2ef66605e4c580acd8d42_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "When clicking, a marker takes priority over the shape.",
      "sourceHash": "7fb2ef66605e4c580acd8d421285e3a8cee252d7ff08c0ab1623db25f983b741",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "de78cf97cf58bb730420b2c74d6996b850bfe147fa535cedf436a2563762d7fb",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "クリックした際、マーカーは図形よりも優先されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2d7a3dd62284e93ddc4b51fe_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Right-clicking a shape opens a contextual menu similar to the one for markers, which allows opening the corresponding note or removing the shape.",
      "sourceHash": "2d7a3dd62284e93ddc4b51fe3f5b17ea6a18135f5378a39e2a5e924059c183c6",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "de78cf97cf58bb730420b2c74d6996b850bfe147fa535cedf436a2563762d7fb",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "図形を右クリックすると、マーカー用と似たコンテキストメニューが開き、対応するノートを開くことや図形を削除することができます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e27ef82223fa6e1197266ea5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Typing in the map's search bar finds shapes by their title, as it does markers. Selecting one brings the whole shape into view.",
      "sourceHash": "e27ef82223fa6e1197266ea589bfc27818981998f9fbf2e0d5336fbf2116cb3d",
      "context": "Drawing shapes > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "de78cf97cf58bb730420b2c74d6996b850bfe147fa535cedf436a2563762d7fb",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "マップの検索バーに入力すると、マーカーと同様にタイトルで図形を検索できます。選択すると、図形全体がビューに表示されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
